        },
        {
          "text": " Ashkeloni ataona haya na kuogopa; Gaza pia, naye atafadhaika sana; na Ekroni, kwa maana matarajio yake yatatahayarika; na mfalme ataangamia toka Gaza, na Ashkeloni atakuwa hana watu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mwana wa haramu atatawala huko Ashdodi, nami nitakatilia mbali kiburi cha Wafilisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami nitaondoa damu yake kinywani mwake, na machukizo yake nitayatoa katika meno yake; yeye naye atakuwa ni mabaki kwa Mungu wetu; naye atakuwa kama mtu mkuu katika Yuda, na Ekroni kama Myebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:8"
