        },
        {
          "text": " Na gari la vita nitaliondoa liwe mbali na Efraimu, na farasi awe mbali na Yerusalemu, na upinde wa vita utaondolewa mbali; naye atawahubiria mataifa yote habari za amani; na mamlaka yake yatakuwa toka bahari hata bahari, na toka Mto hata miisho ya dunia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.61.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 61:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.24.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 24:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Na kwa habari zako wewe, kwa sababu ya damu ya agano lako, nimewatoa wafungwa wako katika shimo lile lisilo na maji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rudini katika ngome yenu, enyi wafungwa wa tumaini; hata hivi leo nasema ya kwamba nitakurudishia maradufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maana nimejipindia Yuda, nimeujaza upinde wangu Efraimu; nami nitawachochea wana wako, Ee Sayuni, wapigane na wana wako, Ee Ugiriki, nami nitakufanya wewe kuwa kama upanga wa shujaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
